he show while their relationship remains strained.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kW8d62bz5Mqoo8i6FbVbXlK9PZI.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"Tomo and Rupa join Nina, Subaru, and Momoka, making a five-member band. Momoka informs the rest of an upcoming show they could play, but the five members have such different personalities that it doesn't look like they'd ever come together. Nina and Momoka have different feelings about the band, and they begin the show while their relationship remains strained.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kW8d62bz5Mqoo8i6FbVbXlK9PZI.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17998","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"164212","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"55102","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"241928","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"434127","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"81197","synopsis":"After the live show, Nina and Momoka's fight continues to heat up as they express how they feel. Nina abandons all her escape routes to seriously pursue music professionally. Tomo says she'll quit if Nina and Momoka's rocky relationship continues. Then as Nina starts her first day of her part-time job, Momoka shows up.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tMmH3uhot3jGgusMRUkUSftsGvY.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 8","synopsis":"After the live show, Nina and Momoka's fight continues to heat up as they express how they feel. Nina abandons all her escape routes to seriously pursue music professionally. Tomo says she'll quit if Nina and Momoka's rocky relationship continues. Then as Nina starts her first day of her part-time job, Momoka shows up.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300